All 72 files are accounted for: full-tree sweeps for every sink category plus deep reads of every file containing an entry point or hit. The runtime-wired surface is keyboard/mouse input to an in-game joke console, classpath-only image loading, procedural levels, and in-memory achievements — no disk writes, no sockets, no serialization. The three dangerous primitives (`ApoClassLoader`, `ApoIO`'s HTTP paths, MD5 helper) exist as cloned library code but have zero callers in this variant, so they are reported as reachable=false.

